        "description": "Arrange Graphite 1000 (#18181a) Lufga 24px/600/31.92px copy and Graphite 800 (#454549) body text beside a contained device/product image. Use a Filled Capsule Button below the copy and preserve a 24px element gap; do not enclose the text side in a card."
